## Methodology and Limitations

This is a screening aid, not a legal, FCRA or GDPR determination. `VERIFIED` means at least {{ r.meta.min_independent_domains }} independent domains or one primary/top-tier source; `SINGLE_SOURCE` means identity holds but support is uncorroborated; `CONFLICTED` means a contradiction or identity mismatch and is never presented as fact. Severity is a rule-based label from legal status and category, not a probability. Identity is matched on name and context terms only; namesakes can still slip through. Findings come from retrieved public sources and exclude anything unretrievable.

